#: ../../webgis-src/chb2_using-mapserver/sec04_one-layer/section.rst:6
msgid ""
"This section begins with using vector data in MapServer. Vector data is "
"similar to vector data in CAD software or illustrator. In addition to the"
" difference of geospatial location, another important aspect is that "
"vector data in GIS has no style information. CAD or illustrator mainly "
"focuses on drawing, and the vector data used need to be distinguished and"
" beautified by width, color and style. In GIS, these works are completed "
"by the map drawing stage. The same data can be drawn in different "
"thematic maps and different application scenarios."
msgstr ""

