#: ../../webgis-src/chb2_using-mapserver/sec08_labels/section.rst:16
msgid ""
"MapServer has a very flexible annotation engine. It supports local "
"bitmaps and TrueType fonts. Font scaling uses TrueType support. The angle"
" and placement of the dimensions can be customized."
